 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Moto Sentouyou Dorei desu ga, Tasukete Kureta Ryuu Hito wa Banda Sou desu."
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "元戦闘用奴隷ですが、助けてくれた竜人は番だそうです。"
   },
   {
    "en": "I Was a Slave Warrior, but the Dragon Who Saved Me Says I'm His Fated Mate"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "“From Slave Warrior to Fated Mate – An Unexpected Encounter That Changes Destiny!”\n\nShe lived her life in hell, nothing more than a tool for battle, forced to fight in brutal arenas day after day, with no hope of freedom.\n\nOne day, a mighty warrior from the dragon race arrives on a mission to destroy the illegal fighting ring. As he watches her fight for survival, he feels something unexplainable—she is his fated mate, the one destined for him by fate!\n\nWhat seemed like a mere coincidence soon becomes a turning point in both their lives, as destiny begins to weave their fates together, changing everything.\n\nCan freedom and love await her after a lifetime of suffering?\n\nA thrilling romantic fantasy about a battle-hardened slave girl and a dragon warrior who sees her as more than just a fighter—he sees his destined partner!"
  },
